<title>PORTUGAL: Cinca share trade suspended in Lisbon.</title>
<headline>Cinca share trade suspended in Lisbon.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Financial Markets Committee suspended trade in ceramics concern Cinca-Companhia Industrial de Ceramica on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>No reasons were given for the suspension.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
